<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψευδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without deceit,
			truthful,</i> esp. of oracles and the like , <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.152
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάντις ἀ.,</span> of
			Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				559
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				350.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				29
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Tit.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψευδεῖ&lt;&gt;τέχνῃ,</span> of augury, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					869
				</span></i>
			; <i>unerring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				160d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάρτυσ-έστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.341
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>uncorrupt,</i>
			
			<i>pure from all deceit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρὸς ἄκμονι χάλκευε γλῶσσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.86
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀψευδής,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώνειον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.78
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δέως,</span>
			
				Att.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς,</span>
			<i>really and truly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀ. ἄριστοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.19
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα, ἐρεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.34
				</span></i>
			.</div>
